Usage:  [GLOBAL OPTIONS] <COMMAND> [OPTIONS]

Available Commands:
 exit                      exits the debugger
 run                       runs main function
 pause                     pauses running VM
 continue                  resumes VM execution
 status                    writes current VM status
 position                  writes current position
 step                      executes one step
 eval                      evaluates runtime expression
 break                     sets or unsets the breakpoint

Global options:
  -h, --help               Display this information.

Run ' <COMMAND> --help for more information on a command.
